# Brainium extension: production data honesty

Add these rows to the incident table in `brainium.mdc` (or reference this file from your project README):

| Trigger | Required capture |
|---------|------------------|
| Bootstrap `seed*IfEmpty` inserts **user-visible** marketing or demo listings | **`learnings/`** (infra vs fictional published) + update project data-audit doc |
| API “wired” but UI still shows placeholder seed rows | **`failures/`** (honesty gap) + migration or remove seed from bootstrap |

Before shipping list/catalog features: grep for `DEMO_`, `seed*IfEmpty`, and mock merges in UI code.
